B.c15=new A.uj("Is power save eating it? (display)",B.b1D,"A voice client that sleeps between packets sounds exactly like a network with loss, and the far end's own report will call it loss. The Power Management bit rides in the frame control field of every frame, so watch for where it flips rather than looking for a single announcement.")
