B.c16=new A.uj("What the endpoint itself says: RTCP (display)",B.b_L,"An RTCP receiver report is a measurement rather than an inference: it is the far endpoint stating what it actually received. That makes it the honest answer to a question this app deliberately does not compute for you.")
