B.as0=new A.p7("EAP-FAST","Username + password protected by a PAC, inside TLS tunnel","Optional","No (optional)","Cisco-originated alternative to PEAP that avoids mandatory PKI by using a PAC. PAC provisioning (anonymous in-band Phase 0) is the weak point. Largely superseded by TEAP (RFC 9930).")
B.arZ=new A.p7("EAP-PWD","Username + shared password (no certificates)","No","No","Password-authenticated key exchange (dragonfly/SAE-family). Resists offline dictionary attack without any PKI. Niche adoption; useful where certificates are impractical.")
B.arW=new A.p7("EAP-SIM","GSM SIM credentials (shared key on SIM)","No","No (SIM is the credential)","Carrier Wi-Fi / hotspot offload using the GSM SIM. Authenticates against the operator HLR/AuC. Legacy 2G/3G; weaker than AKA.")
