B.c6F=new A.wS("SAE (Simultaneous Authentication of Equals)","WPA3-Personal","Replaces PSK 4-way handshake. Forward secrecy. Resistant to offline dictionary attacks even if the passphrase is short.")
B.c6B=new A.wS("PMF: Protected Management Frames","Optional: WPA2 \xb7 Required: WPA3","Encrypts deauth and disassociation frames (802.11w). Prevents deauth flood attacks.")
B.c6C=new A.wS("OWE: Opportunistic Wireless Encryption","Enhanced Open only","Encrypts open-network sessions without a password. No authentication, but eavesdropping is prevented.")
B.c6D=new A.wS("Forward Secrecy","WPA3-Personal (SAE), WPA3-Enterprise","Session keys are ephemeral. Captured traffic cannot be decrypted retroactively even if the passphrase is later compromised.")
B.c6E=new A.wS("192-bit Security Mode","WPA3-Enterprise only","GCMP-256 + HMAC-SHA-384 + ECDH/ECDSA-384. Required for government and classified deployments.")
B.c6A=new A.wS("WPA3 mandatory on 6 GHz","All Wi-Fi 6E / Wi-Fi 7","6 GHz band requires WPA3 or OWE. WPA2 and older protocols are not permitted on 6 GHz.")
B.c6G=new A.wS("802.1X / RADIUS roles","WPA2/WPA3-Enterprise","Supplicant (client) \u2192 Authenticator (AP) \u2192 Authentication Server (RADIUS). EAP tunnel carries credential exchange.")
