B.c87=new A.x_("Know this one cold. The horizontal permanent link is a maximum of 90 m of solid horizontal cable, from the telecom room to the work-area outlet. Add up to 10 m of stranded patch and equipment cords and you get a 100 m channel maximum. Exceed it and you are outside TIA.",null)
