B.brf=new A.Z("Discovery with MAC addresses","On this platform the toolbox sweeps the local subnet and reads the kernel neighbor table to attach each responder's real MAC address. macOS reads it through a native sysctl call, Windows through the IP Helper API. No subprocess, no elevated privilege. If a read fails, the toolbox says so rather than reporting the MAC as unavailable.")
