B.btc=new A.Z("Discovery only: MAC not exposed",'This platform sandboxes the neighbor table away from apps, and shelling out to the system arp command is blocked. The toolbox sweeps the local subnet and lists every host that answers; MAC addresses are shown as "Not exposed on this platform" rather than guessed.')
